1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,766
Wake up to this view at an all-inclusive in Turks and Caicos.

2
00:00:03,816 --> 00:00:08,941
This room at Beaches Turks and Caicos has a big arched window right onto the sea.

3
00:00:08,992 --> 00:00:14,406
There are seven hundred fifty-seven rooms, with premium bedding and a forty-inch smart TV.

4
00:00:14,456 --> 00:00:18,565
Some come with a balcony, and Grace Bay Beach is a five minute walk.

5
00:00:18,614 --> 00:00:22,006
Bathrooms have designer toiletries and soaking tubs.

6
00:00:22,056 --> 00:00:25,108
Breakfast is free, and so is the airport shuttle.

7
00:00:25,158 --> 00:00:30,774
Guests rate it eight point six out of ten, from seven hundred sixty-nine reviews on Expedia.

8
00:00:30,824 --> 00:00:34,850
The full tour is on my channel.
